msgstr "Dijeda"

#: src/components/common/text.ts
msgid "Paused because Amazon SES paused this inbox's tenant, or the channel lost its tenant isolation. Resume it once the server's operator has fixed that."
msgstr "Dijeda kerana Amazon SES menjeda penyewa peti masuk ini, atau saluran kehilangan pengasingan penyewa. Sambungkannya setelah pengendali pelayan membetulkannya."

#: src/components/common/text.ts
msgid "Paused because the workspace may not send broadcasts for now."
msgstr "Dijeda kerana ruang kerja tidak boleh menghantar siaran buat masa ini."

#: src/components/common/text.ts
msgid "Paused by the server's operator."
msgstr "Dijeda oleh pengendali pelayan."

#: src/components/common/text.ts
msgid "Paused by your team."
msgstr "Dijeda oleh pasukan anda."

#: src/components/common/text.ts
msgid "Paused on its own: 0.3% or more of the recipients reported the mail as spam, the most mail providers accept. Make sure everyone on the lists asked for this mail before you resume."
msgstr "Dijeda sendiri: 0.3% atau lebih penerima melaporkan mel sebagai spam, had maksimum yang diterima kebanyakan penyedia mel. Pastikan semua orang dalam senarai meminta mel ini sebelum anda menyambung."

#: src/components/common/text.ts
msgid "Paused on its own: 5% or more of the mails sent bounced. Check the list for old or mistyped addresses before you resume."
msgstr "Dijeda sendiri: 5% atau lebih mel yang dihantar melantun. Semak senarai untuk alamat lama atau tersalah taip sebelum anda menyambung."

#: src/components/common/text.ts
msgid "Paused on its own: the SMTP server refused the account, its encryption or too many mails in a row. Check the channel's broadcast account, then resume."
msgstr "Dijeda sendiri: pelayan SMTP menolak akaun, penyulitannya atau terlalu banyak mel berturut-turut. Semak akaun siaran saluran, kemudian sambung."

#: src/features/migrations/CopyStep.tsx
msgid "Paused. Nothing is read from {address} until you resume."
msgstr "Dijeda. Tiada apa dibaca daripada {address} sehingga anda menyambung."

